==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{deverbal|ru|уда́рить}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|уда́р}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-удар.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|ar|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|уда́р|adj=уда́рный}} ({{verbal noun of|ru|уда́рить|qq=nomen actionis instantiae; nomen qualitatis (metonymically)}})

# [[hit]], [[blow]], [[strike]], [[kick]], [[punch]], [[cuff]]  {{C|ru|Hit}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[быть]] [[в]] '''уда́ре'''|to be on '''a roll''' / to be on '''fire'''}}
# {{lb|ru|metonymic}} the [[sound]] of such an [[impact]]
# {{lb|ru|metonymic}} the [[quality]] or [[ability]] of such an impact
#: {{coi|ru|[[хорошо́]] [[поста́вленный]] '''уда́р'''|}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively|military}} a [[quick]], [[sudden]] [[offensive]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''уда́р''' [[по]] [[врагу́]]|'''a blow''' against an enemy}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively|military}} [[bombardment]], [[shelling]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я́дерный]] '''уда́р'''|nuclear '''strike'''}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} [[blow]] (heavy shock, unexpected trouble)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''уда́ры''' [[судьбы́]]|'''blows''' of fate}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[эта|Э́та]] [[поте́ря]] [[ста́ла]] [[для]] [[нас]] [[ощутимый|ощути́мым]] '''уда́ром'''.|This loss was a real '''blow''' to us.}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively|medicine}} [[apoplexy]], [[sudden]] [[severe]] [[disease]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[серде́чный]] '''удар'''|heart '''attack''' (less common term than {{m|ru|[[серде́чный]] [[при́ступ]]}})}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[со́лнечный]] '''удар'''|sun'''stroke'''}}

